{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーいあみウサギです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょん❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのですね、前回の乃木どこのオンエアを観たんですけど、\nあーこれはちょっと私のこと心配しだす人たくさんいそうだなと思い急遽ブログ書きました、はい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしね、人に説明するの本当に苦手なのよ、だからどうしても人に自分の意見を説明するときってやばいくらい力入っちゃうんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからあの本にわたしが洗脳されてる訳でもなんでもなく、\nあくまで「引き寄せの法則」っていうものがこの世には存在するらしいのよっていうのを皆様にお伝えしたかっただけなのですね(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、なのでわたし全然やばい奴でもなんでもないのでー（＾∇＾）\nそれだけは信じてくださいっつ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに実際あれの本当のPOP女王は確実にまいまいとか真夏あたりですよね(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのオススメ本「ザ シークレット」\nすごく考え方が前向きになれる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでみてね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ2ndとうとう終わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18公演...やったんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じられない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなね本当にボロッボロになりながらそれでも毎回良い公演にしたくてたくさん話しあいながらライブをやってきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなロングランライブはもちろんだけどやったことがなかったから\n自分の気持ちは元気でも体がついていかないなんてことも初めてで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんななんとか耐えぬきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの1人MCは千秋楽の昼公演でした！\nもう緊張しすぎてお腹ぐるぐるなってたもん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！なんとね今回ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーと研究生全員と写真とったんだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきます(*^◯^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/21/3149915/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-